'''Global Esports''' is an [[:Category:India|Indian]] esports organization. They previously had rosters in [[:counterstrike:Global_Esports|Counter-Strike]], [[:dota2:Global_Esports|Dota 2]], [[:overwatch:Global_Esports|Overwatch]] and [[:pubgmobile:Global_Esports|PUBG Mobile]]. They entered ''VALORANT'' by signing the [[God Squad]] roster.

